		<description><![CDATA[It could be said that there is no problem that can not be solved with violence.   I would concur that some problems can be solved with violence, but problem is the solution is always temporary.  Philosophies, even bad ones, are ratified in the blood of their purveyor.  Populations become more fearless as they cornered and [&#8230;]]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="simplesocialbuttons">
<div class="simplesocialbutton ssb-button-twitter"><!-- Twitter--><a href="https://twitter.com/share" class="twitter-share-button" data-text="Violence is not a solution" data-url="http://civgene.matthewnewhall.com/archives/52" rel="nofollow"></a></div>
